  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Funded Post - Water Resource Accountability in Pakistan (WRAP) Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An in-house programme funded is likely to improve effectiveness of programme interventions by an additional 50% at least by offering niche to influence the programme work at a bigger scale for both partners and government counterparts. I.e., programme efforts are likely to be better sustained.
Improved effectiveness across the portfolio to manage relationships with key government stakeholders and work with the institutional strengthening partner to strengthen programme coordination, effectiveness and sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
